り、受け(成島・真ん中分けのほう)をこじれたおじさんだなあと思っております…\n\nお時間いただけるようでしたら、描いていただけますと嬉しいです\nどうぞよろしくお願いいたします…！\n\n━\n\n資料など\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Em0A7oJE8eG-AR5wBjk0IqihWFvmN0PM?usp=share_link\nまんがフォルダ、カップリング深掘りシートフォルダが入っています\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Em0A7oJE8eG-AR5wBjk0IqihWFvmN0PM?usp=share_link", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 194188, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "ベネディクタ（pixiv・skebリクエスト受付中）", "screen_name": "yamamaya4", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1648234218978156544/_LO0nOGV.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/124104742/1681804636/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "novel"}], "nc": 41}, {"id": 391592, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "みつ葉", "screen_name": "mitsuba0605", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1916979448240652288/x3RjOCnJ.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/18133204/1757094636/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 5, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "video"}], "nc": 49}, {"id": 561582, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "りっき。🐈", "screen_name": "ganba_rikki", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2035831511036153856/2nLU1xuw.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/890777668840337408/1675217363/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_ran